| 2007 | 36.2% | 145 | 0.82 | 0.206 | ✗ |
| 2008 | 38.5% | 152 | 1.95 | 0.027 | ✓ |
| **2009** | **43.1%** | **148** | **3.12** | **0.001** | **✓** |
| 2010 | 39.7% | 156 | 2.34 | 0.009 | ✓ |
| 2011 | 37.8% | 149 | 1.54 | 0.062 | ✗ |

**Interpretation**: 2008–2010 show significantly elevated LGD (p < 0.05); 2009 is the worst.

